                </listBibl>
            </div>
            <div type="edition" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="div2LIT7815DersanaGa">
                <note>The following edition contains all textparts, which are attested in 
                    <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/36J4KMXD"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Makweriya1976DersanaGabriel"/><title level="m">ድርሳነ፡ ገብርኤል። ከግዕዝ ወደአማርኛ፡ ተተርጓምና ተዘጋጅቶ (Dǝrsāna Gabrǝʾel, kagǝʿǝz wadaʾamārǝññā tatargʷǝmǝnnā tazagāǧǧǝto, ’Homiliary of Gabriel, translated from Gǝʿǝz to Amharic’)</title><author><name>Makʷǝriyā ʾAbyehoy</name></author><pubPlace>Addis Ababa</pubPlace><date>1976</date><note type="accessed">2026-01-14</note><note type="url">https://betamasaheft.eu/manuscripts/EMIP01281/</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Makweriya1976DersanaGabriel</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Makweriya1976DersanaGabriel</note></bibl>, containing rhyming preambles, a homily and one or several
                    miracles for each month as well as a rhyming strophe at the end of each monthly section.</note>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Tahsas">
               <label xml:lang="en">Reading for 19 Tāḫśāś</label>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TahsPream">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Preamble for Tāḫśāś</label>
                  <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩፡ አምላክ፡ ድርሳን፡<lb/>
                     ዘቅዱስ፡ ገብርኤል፡ ሊቀ፡ መላእክት፡ ፍሡሐ፡ ገጽ፡ እምእለ፡ ይተግሁ፡ መላእክት፡ ቅዱሳን፡<lb/>
                     አብሣሬ፡ ፍሥሓ፡ ወሐሤት፡ ለኵሉ፡ ዓለም፡ ጸሎቱ፡ ወበረከቱ፡ የሃሉ፡ ምስለ፡ ገብሩ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="CH" unit="chars" quantity="7"/>
                      ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን።</ab>
               </div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="HomilyZechariah" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7718HomilyGab">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Homily on the Annunciation of the Archangel Gabriel to Zechariah, Father of John the Baptist</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TahsasMiracle" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7807TahsasMir">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle performed to Romanos in Jersusalem</label></div>   
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TahsasStr">
               <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming strophe in honour of Gabriel for Tāḫśāś</label>
               <ab>ዘአንሣእኮ፡ ገብርኤል፡ ለእንተ፡ ሞተ፡ ብእሲ።<lb/>
                  አመ፡ ኵላንታሁ፡ ይመልዕ፡ ኅምዘ፡ መድንግጽ፡ ከይሲ።<lb/>
                  አመ፡ በጉባኤ፡ ይከውን፡ ምጽአተ፡ አምላክ፡ ተአጋሢ።<lb/>
                  አንሥአኒ፡ እሞተ፡ ነፍስ፡ እንዘ፡ እክለ፡ ምሕረት፡ ትሴሲ።<lb/>
                  ግዑዘ፡ ገሀነም፡ እኩን፡ ገብርከ፡ አባሲ።</ab>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Terr">
               <label xml:lang="en">Reading for 19 Ṭǝrr</label>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TerrPream">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Preamble for Ṭǝrr</label>
                  <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩ዱ፡ አምላክ፡ ታሉት፡ ዘኢይሰደቅ፡<lb/>
                     በሥልጣኑ፡ ወበመለኮቱ፡ ዘኢይትነፈቅ።<lb/>
                     እንዘ፡ ክቡት፡ በባሕርዩ፡ ወበፍጥረቱ፡ ዘይትዐወቅ።<lb/>
                     ዘይፌንዎ፡ ለፀዓዕ፡ ወይመውዖ፡ ለመብረቅ።<lb/>
                     ዘየአቁር፡ ማያተ፡ በከርሠ፡ ደመና፡ ረቂቅ።<lb/>
                     ትንቱናነ፡ ዘይሠውቅ። ወኃጥአነ፡ ዘያጸድቅ።<lb/>
                     ዘሎቱ፡ ስብሐት፡ እምኀበ፡ ዕድ፡ ወአንስት፡ ወእምኀበ፡ አእሩግ፡ ወደቂቅ።<lb/></ab>
               </div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TerrHomily" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7773HomilyJohn">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Homily of St John the Evangelist</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TerrMiracle" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7808TerrMir">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of the healing of a day labourer who was hit by a stone</label></div>
            
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TerrMiracle2" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7774MiracTerr2">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of how St Gabriel was sent to save the body of St George</label></div>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TerrStr">
               <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming strophe in honour of Gabriel for Ṭǝrr</label>
               <ab>ለጊዮርጊስ፡ ክቡር፡ መክብበ፡ ክቡራን፡ ሰማዕት።<lb/>
                  እንተ፡ ሥጋሁ፡ አውጻእከ፡ እምጤገነ፡ ብርት።<lb/>
                  አሠርግወኒ፡ ገብርኤል፡ በልብሰ፡ ንጽሕና፡ ሜላት።<lb/>
                  ከመ፡ እኩን፡ ስቡረ፡ እግር፡ እምሐዊረ፡ ጌጋይ፡ ፍኖት።<lb/>
                  እስመ፡ ረባሕየ፡ መከራ፡ ወሞት።</ab>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Yakkatit">
               <label>Reading for 19 Yakkātit</label>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="YakkPream">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Preamble for Yakkātit</label>
                  <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩ዱ፡ አምላክ፡ ዘይሤለስ፡ በገጽ፡ ወበአካል፡<lb/>
                     ወይትዋሐድ፡ በመለኮት፡ ወኃይል፡<lb/>
                     ወመሠረት፡ ዘኢያንቀለቅል፡<lb/>
                     ወመዝገብ፡ ዘኢይቀብል፡<lb/>
                     ፀወን፡ ዘኢይንህል።<lb/>
                     ውእቱ፡ ያነዲ፡ ወያብዕል፡<lb/>
                     ይቀስፍ፡ ወይሠሃል፡<lb/>
                     ውእቱ፡ የዓፅብ፡ ወያቀልል፡<lb/>
                     ዘኪያሁ፡ ኵሉ፡ ይስዕል፡<lb/>
                     ወኀቤሁ፡ ይትመሀለል፡</ab>
               </div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="YakkHomily" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6508DersanaG">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Homily delivered by Epiphanius, honoured Bishop of the Land of Cyprus</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MiracleBuilding" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4656MiracleGa">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of the building of a church dedicated to St Gabriel</label></div>
            
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="YakkMir2" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7776YakkMir2">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of how he gave a sword to St Mercurius</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="YakkStr">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming strophe in honour of Gabriel for Yakkātit</label>
                  <ab>ዘተራዳእኮ፡ ገብርኤል፡ ሥርግወ፡ ነዳዲ፡ እሳት።<lb/>
                     በጊዜ፡ ወጠነ፡ ፀብዐ፡ ምስለ፡ ፀባዒት።<lb/>
                     መርቆሬዎስ፡ ዘሮሜ፡ ምሉዐ፡ ጸጋ፡ ወሀብት።<lb/>
                     እንበለ፡ ረድኤትከሰ፡ ዘኢይፈርሆ፡ ለሞት።<lb/>
                     አልቦ፡ ጻድቅ፡ ወአልቦ፡ ሰማዕት።</ab>
               </div>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Maggabit">
               <label>Reading for 19 Maggābit</label>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MaggPream">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Preamble for Maggābit</label>
                  <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩ዱ፡ አምላክ፡ ሥላሴ፡ በኢተሌልዮ፡<lb/>
                     ወክቡተ፡ ባሕርይ፡ እምተሀልዮ።<lb/>
                     መኑ፡ ዘለቅሖ፡ ወመኑ፡ ዘተፈድዮ፡<lb/>
                     መኑ፡ ዘአእመሮ፡ ወመኑ፡ ዘርእዮ፡<lb/>
                     መኑ፡ ዘይኤዝዞ፡ ወመኑ፡ ዘይቀንዮ፡<lb/>
                     ለርኁብ፡ ዘይሴስዮ፡<lb/>
                     ወለጽሙዕ፡ ዘያሰትዮ።<lb/>
                     ዘሎቱ፡ ይደሉ፡ እምኀቤነ፡ ሰጊድ፡ ወተጋንዮ፡<lb/>
                     ወለነኒ፡ ይደልወነ፡ እምኀቤሁ፡ ምሕረት፡ ወአሠንዮ።</ab>
               </div>
              
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MaggHom" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7777MaggHom">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Homily concerning God’s promise to Adam</label></div>
              
                <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MaggMir" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7194MGAbraset">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of ʾAbrāsit</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MaggMir2" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7779MaggMir2">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of how he tore the veil of the Temple</label></div>
            
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MaggStr">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Strophe in honour of Gabriel for Maggābit</label>
                  <ab>አጽምሞተ፡ ዕዝንከ፡ ምንት፡ እምሰሚዓ፡ ብዙኅ፡ ጸሎቱ።<lb/>
                     ለሰብእናየ፡ ግፉእ፡ እንተ፡ ረዳኢ፡ አልቦቱ።<lb/>
                     መንሥኤ፡ ሙታን፡ ገብርኤል፡ ዘተሰማዕከ፡ በዕለተ፡ ሞቱ።<lb/>
                     ለስሐኑ፡ ሰይፍከ፡ እስከነ፡ ላዕሉ፡ ወታሕቱ።<lb/>
                     መንጦላዕተ፡ ምኵራብ፡ ቅድመ፡ ዘሠጠጥከ፡ ቦቱ።</ab>
               </div>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Miyazya">
               <label>Reading for 19 Miyāzyā</label>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MiyazPream">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Preamble for Miyāzyā</label>
                  <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩ዱ፡ አምላክ፡<lb/>
                     ኢልደት፡ ወልደት፡ ወሥርፀት፡<lb/>
                     እግዚኦሙ፡ ለአጋእዝት፡<lb/>
                     ወንጉሦሙ፡ ለነገሥት፡<lb/>
                     ዘይሴብሕዎ፡ መላእክት፡<lb/>
                     ወየአኵትዎ፡ ሥልጣናት።<lb/>
                     ወኀቤሁ፡ ሞብጻሐ፡ ኵሉ፡ አስተብቍዖት፡<lb/>
                     ወኀቤሁ፡ ተፍጻሜተ፡ ስዕለት።</ab>
               </div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MiyazHom" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7778MiyazHom">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Homily concerning the sufferings of Jesus Christ</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MiyazMir" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7196MGNiqlon">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Miracle concerning the building of a church in the country Neqlon</label></div>
            
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MiyazMir2" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7780MiyazMir2">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of how he helped Paisius and Peter</label></div>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MiyazStr">
               <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Strophe in honour of Gabriel for Miyāzyā</label>
               <ab>አመ፡ አላዊ፡ አዘዘ፡ በዲበ፡ ኅንባዝ፡ ስቅለተ።<lb/>
                  እንዘ፡ ትናዝዞ፡ ገብርኤል፡ ወታስተርእዮ፡ ክሡተ።<lb/>
                  ከመ፡ አጽናእኮ፡ ለብሶይ፡ እስከ፡ ይከውን፡ ሰማዕተ።<lb/>
                  አጽንዓኒ፡ ወአጥብዐኒ፡ ከመ፡ ኢየሐሊ፡ ምንተ፡ እንበለ፡ ርስትየ፡ መቃብር፡ ዘጽኑሕ፡ ሊተ።</ab>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Genbot">
               <label>Reading for 19 Gǝnbot</label>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="GenbPream">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Preamble for Gǝnbot</label>
                  <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩ዱ አምላክ፡ አውሎዶስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ በቅዳሴሁ፡<lb/>
                     ወስቡሕ፡ በስብሐቲሁ።<lb/>
                     ኢይልህቅ፡ አብ፡ እምወልዱ፡<lb/>
                     ወወልድኒ፡ ኢይንእስ፡ እምአቡሁ፡<lb/>
                     አልቦ፡ ዕለት፡ ማእከሌሁ፡<lb/>
                     ወማዕከለ፡ ወልዱ።<lb/>
                     ኵሉ፡ እምኔሁ፡<lb/>
                     ወኵሉ፡ ዘዘዚአሁ፡<lb/>
                     ኵሉ፡ በእንቲአሁ፡<lb/>
                     ወኵሉ፡ እኁዝ፡ ውስተ፡ እራሁ፡<lb/>
                     ኵሉ፡ ግሩር፡ ታሕተ፡ እገሪሁ፡<lb/>
                     ሎቱ፡ ይደሉ፡ እምኀቤነ፡ ኣኰቴት፡ ወለነኒ፡ ይደልወነ፡ ሥርየት፡ እምአቡሁ።</ab>
               </div>
               
                <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="GenbHom" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7197MGKing">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Homily on the golden statue of King Nebuchadnezzar</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="GenbMir" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7811GenbMir">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle about the construction of a church dedicated to St Gabriel in the country Neqlon</label></div>
            
                <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="GenbMir2" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7785GenbMir2">
                    <label xml:lang="en">Miracle on how St Gabriel made ʾAwqronyos, Dimusryā and Minās escape from the lion’s den</label></div>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="GenbStr">
               <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Strophe in honour of Gabriel for Gǝnbot</label>
               <ab>ዘአውፃእኮሙ፡ እምግበ፡ አናብስት፡ በሥምረትከ፡ ኰናኒ።<lb/>
                  ለአቅሮንዮስ፡ ወሚናስ፡ ወዲሙስርያ፡ እኅተ፡ ኣሞ፡ ሊሉየ፡ ምግባሩ፡ ገብርኤል፡ እምግባረ፡ ሰይጣን፡ ተቃራኒ።<lb/>
                  ናዝዘኒ፡ ለገብርከ፡ እምትካዘ፡ ዓለም፡ ማሳኒ።<lb/>
                  እስመ፡ አዕፅምቲሁ፡ ያየብስ፡ ብእሲ፡ ኀዛኒ።</ab>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Sane">
               <label>Reading for Sane</label>
               <note>Usually indicated to be read on 19 Sane, but in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/36J4KMXD"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Makweriya1976DersanaGabriel"/><title level="m">ድርሳነ፡ ገብርኤል። ከግዕዝ ወደአማርኛ፡ ተተርጓምና ተዘጋጅቶ (Dǝrsāna Gabrǝʾel, kagǝʿǝz wadaʾamārǝññā tatargʷǝmǝnnā tazagāǧǧǝto, ’Homiliary of Gabriel, translated from Gǝʿǝz to Amharic’)</title><author><name>Makʷǝriyā ʾAbyehoy</name></author><pubPlace>Addis Ababa</pubPlace><date>1976</date><note type="accessed">2026-01-14</note><note type="url">https://betamasaheft.eu/manuscripts/EMIP01281/</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Makweriya1976DersanaGabriel</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Makweriya1976DersanaGabriel</note><citedRange unit="page">178</citedRange></bibl> it is indicated for 26 Sane.</note>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="SanePream">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Preamble for Sane</label>
                  <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩አምላክ፡ አሐቲ፡ ሥልጣን፡<lb/>
                     ወአሐቲ፡ ምኵናን፡<lb/>
                     ውእቱ፡ ህልው፡ እምቅድመ፡ አዝማን፡<lb/>
                     ጥንተ፡ ቅድምናሁ፡ ዘኢይትሜጠን፡<lb/>
                     ወጽንፈ፡ ተድኅሮሁ፡ ዘኢይትዌሰን።<lb/>
                     ዘይሤውር፡ ኃጣውአ፡ ወአበሳተ፡ ዘይከድን፡<lb/>
                     ዘያሠርቅ፡ ፀሐየ፡ ላዕለ፡ ጻድቃን፡<lb/> 
                     ወኃጥአን።<lb/>  
                     ወያዘንም፡ ዝናመ፡ ላዕለ፡ ኄራን፡<lb/>
                     ወእኵያን፡ ሎቱ፡ ስብሐት፡ እምኵሉ፡ አፍ፡ ወልሳን።</ab>
               </div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="SaneHomily" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7786SaneHomily">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Homily of Alexander ʾAbawre, bishop of Fayyūm</label>
               </div>
            
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MiracleSatan" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7204MGSatan">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle concerning how Satan tried to interfere with the building of the church</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="SaneMir2" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7787SaneMir2">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of how St Gabriel gave a sword to Claudius</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="SaneStr">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Strophe in honour of Gabriel for Sane</label>
                  <ab>ለገላውዴዎስ፡ ሰማዕት፡ ዘክብረ፡ ሰማዕታት፡ ተወከፈ፡<lb/>
                     ከመ፡ ወሀብኮ፡ ቀዳሚ፡ ዘእሳት፡ ሰይፈ፡<lb/>
                     ንስረ፡ አርያም፡ ገብርኤል፡ አንተ፡ አቅለልከ፡ አክናፈ።<lb/>
                     ሀበኒ፡ ለገብርከ፡ ከመ፡ ቃለ፡ ነቢይ፡ ጸሐፈ።<lb/>
                     እንዘ፡ አሐዱ፡ እምአጽራርየ፡ ከመ፡ እስድድ፡ እልፈ።</ab>
               </div>
            </div>
              
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Hamle">
               <label>Reading for 19 Ḥamle</label>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="HamlePream">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Preamble for Ḥamle</label>
                  <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩ዱ፡ አምላክ፡ ጌርዮስ፡ ፓንዋማ፡ ዕሩየ፡ ምልክና፡ ወኅቡረ፡ ቅድምና፡ ዘይፈትን፡ ኵሎ።<lb/>
                     እምቅድመ፡ ልቡና፡ ዘያርኁ፡ ክረምተ፡ በበዓመት፡ ወይገለብቦ፡ ለሰማይ፡ በደመና፡ ወለምድር፡ በሐመልማል፡ ዘይከድና፡ ለማየ፡ ባሕር፡ በኅፍኑ፡ ዘየሐፍና።<lb/>
                     ወለየብስኒ፡ በስዝሩ፡ ዘይሜጥና፡ ሎቱ፡ ይደሉ፡ እምኀቤነ፡ መሐና፡ ወለነ፡ እምኀቤሁ፡ ዳኅና።</ab>
               </div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="HamleHom" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7788HamleHom">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Homily concerning Alexander the Great</label></div>
            
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="HamleMir" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7812HamleMir">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle about the erection of columns in a church</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="HamleStr">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Strophe in honour of Gabriel for Ḥamle</label>
                  <ab>ዘተራዳዕኮ፡ ገብርኤል፡ ለዝሕንፃ፡ መቅደስ፡ ወጠነ።<lb/>
                     በማዕሠረ፡ ሐፂን፡ ወብርት፡ እንዘ፡ ተአሥር፡ ሰይጣነ፡<lb/>
                     አጽራርየ፡ አመ፡ ወገሩ፡ አዕባነ፡<lb/>
                     መንገለ፡ ሀሎኩ፡ አነ፡<lb/>
                     እስከ፡ ይከሥቱ፡ ኪዳኖሙ፡ ዓይነ።</ab>
               </div>
         </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Nahase">
               <label>Reading for 19 Naḥase</label>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="NahasePream">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Preamble for Naḥase</label>
                  <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩ዱ፡ አምላክ፡ ሥላሴ፡<lb/>
                     በተዋሕዶ፡ ወተዋሕዶ፡ በሥላሴ፡<lb/> 
                     ዘይሜግብ፡ መላእክተ፡ በቅዳሴ፡<lb/>
                     ወበእክል፡ ምድራዌ፡ ብእሴ፡<lb/>
                     አራዊተ፡ በሥጋ፡ ወእን<choice resp="CH"><sic>ሰ</sic><corr>ስ</corr></choice>ሳተ፡ በሣዕር፡ አዕዋፈ፡ ወዕፄያተ፡ በቆፅል፡ ዘሎቱ፡ ይደልዎ፡ 
                     እምኀቤነ፡ ውዳሴ፡<lb/>
                     ወለነ፡ ይደልወነ፡ እምኀቤሁ፡ ተባልሆ፡ እምደምሳሴ።</ab>
               </div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="NahaseHom" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7789NahaseHom">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Homily on the Annunciation</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MiracleParalytic" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7200MGParalytic">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of the healing of a paralytic and leprous man</label></div>
            
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="NahaseMir2" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7791NahaseMir2">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of how he saved Timotheus the Martyr</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="NahaseStr">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Strophe in honour of Gabriel for Naḥase</label>
                  <ab>ለጢሞቴዎስ፡ ሰማዕት፡ አክሊለ፡ ስምዕ፡ ዘነሥአ።<lb/>
                     ዘበክንፍከ፡ ከለልኮ፡ አመ፡ ውስተ፡ እሳት፡ ቦአ።<lb/>
                     ረዳኤ፡ ግፉዓ፡ ገብርኤል፡ እንበለ፡ ትኅሥሥ፡ መርድአ።<lb/>
                     ያስትአፅብ፡ መንክራቲከ፡ ወኂሩተከ፡ ስሙዐ።<lb/>
                     እምነ፡ ገፋዒ፡ ትባልሕ፡ ኪያየ፡ ግፉዐ።</ab>
               </div>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Maskaram">
               <label>Reading for 19 Maskaram</label>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MaskPream">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Preamble for Maskaram</label>
                  <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩፡ አምላክ፡ ተከፍሎ፡<lb/>
                     በተጋብኦ፡ ወተጋብኦ፡ በተከፍሎ።<lb/>
                     እምቅድመ፡ ዓለማት፡ በትሥልስቱ፡ ዘሀሎ።<lb/>
                     ለሰማይ፡ በከዋክብት፡ ዘከለሎ፡<lb/>
                     ወለምድርኒ፡ ዘይከድና፡ ሐመልማላተ፡ አብቍሎ፡ ወዘአቀመ፡ መሠረታ፡ በዓምደ፡ አውሎ፡<lb/>
                     ለትሑት፡ ዘያሌዕሎ።<lb/>                 
                     ወለነዳይ፡ ዘያብዕሎ፡<lb/>
                     ዘሎቱ፡ ይደሉ፡ እምኀቤነ፡ ሰብሖ፡ ወለነ፡ ይደልወነ፡ እምኀቤሁ፡ ተሣህሎ፡</ab>
               </div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MaskHom" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7790MaskHom">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Homily concerning Zechariah of Abijah</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MaskMir" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7208MGBaradyos">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Miracle on Barādyos</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MaskMir2" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7813MaskMir">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of Our Lady Mary visiting the pregnant St Elisabeth</label></div>
            
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MaskMir3" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7792MaskMir3">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of St Gabriel helping Timothy and St Theodore</label></div>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="MaskStr">
               <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Strophe in honour of Gabriel for Maskaram</label>
               <ab>ሰላም፡ ለቴዎድሮስ፡ ምስለ፡ ሰብአ፡ አፍራስ፡ ዘተበአሰ፡<lb/>
                  እንተ፡ ወሀብኮ፡ ገብርኤል፤ መንፈሳዊ፡ ፈረሰ፡<lb/>
                  ምስለ፡ መሬታዊት፡ ሥጋየ፡ ለዘአማኅፀንኩከ፡ ነፍሰ።<lb/>
                  መንገለ፡ ሰማይ፡ አመ፡ አርታዕኩ፡ ፈሊሰ።<lb/>
                  በቅድመ፡ ገጽከ፡ ሀበኒ፡ ሞገሰ።</ab>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Teqemt">
               <label>Reading for 19 Ṭǝqǝmt</label>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TeqPream">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Preamble for Ṭǝqǝmt</label>
                  <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩ዱ፡ አምላክ።<lb/>
                     ዘግጻዌሁ፡ ሊሉይ፡<lb/>
                     ወበሥልጣኑ፡ ዕሩይ፡<lb/> 
                     መንበረ፡ መንግሥቱ፡ ዘበረድ፡ ጽሩይ።<lb/>
                     ወመንጦላዕቱ፡ በእሳት፡ ርሱይ።<lb/>
                     ዘፈጠሮሙ፡ ለወርኅ፡ ወለፀሐይ፡<lb/>
                     ከመ፡ ያብርኁ፡ በመዓልት፡ ወበለያልይ።<lb/>
                     ዘለሐኮ፡ ለሰብእ፡ እምነፋሰ፡ ወእሳት፡ እመሬት፡ ወእማይ።<lb/>
                     ዘሎቱ፡ ግናይ፡<lb/>
                     እምኀበ፡ ንዑስ፡ ወዐቢይ።<lb/>
                     እምኀበ፡ ባዕል፡ ወነዳይ።</ab>
               </div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TeqHom" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7793TeqHom">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Homily of Our Lady Mary as a child</label></div>
               
                <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="HomilyFalasforos" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7199MGFalasforos">
                    <label xml:lang="en">Miracle concerning the merchant Falāsforon</label></div>
                               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TeqMir2" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7794TeqMir2">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of St Gabriel’s appearance to Isaac, the king of Rome, who was called Garimā</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="TeqStr">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Strophe in honour of Gabriel for Ṭǝqǝmt</label>
                  <ab>እንዘ፡ መልዕልተ፡ ክንፍ፡ ትፀውረኒ፡ ለዘአስተጋ፡ ባዕኩ፡ ከንቶ።<lb/>
                     ወታርእየኒ፡ ገጸከ፡ በገሃድ፡ ወበተከሥቶ።<lb/>
                     ገብርኤል፡ መርሃኒ፡ ለገዳመ፡ ጻድቃን፡ ፍኖቶ፡<lb/> 
                     ለይስሐቅ፡ ንጉሠ፡ ሮም፡ ከመ፡ አርታዕከ፡ ሑረቶ።<lb/> 
                     አመ፡ ውስተ፡ ገዳም፡ ሖረ፡ እንዘ፡ የኃድግ፡ መንግሥቶ።</ab>
               </div>
            </div>
            
            <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Hedar">
               <label>Reading for 19 Ḫǝdār</label>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="HedarPream">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Preamble for Ḫǝdār</label>
                  <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩ዱ አምላክ።<lb/> 
                     <gap reason="omitted" unit="chars" quantity="5"/> ዘይሤለስ፡ በግፃዌ፡<lb/> 
                     ወይትዋሐድ፡ በህላዌ።<lb/>
                     ወሀቢ፡ በኢድንጻዌ፡<lb/>
                     ወጻድቅ፡ በኢሕሳዌ።<lb/>
                     ዘይመይጥ፡ ጼውዋነ፡ እምጼዋዌ፡<lb/>
                     ወያጥዒ፡ ሕሙማነ፡ እምደዌ።<lb/>
                     ዘሎቱ፡ ይደሉ፡ እምኀቤነ፡ ሰባሔ፡<lb/> 
                     ወለነ፡ ይደልወነ፡ እምኀቤሁ፡ ተባልሆ፡ እምንሳዊ።</ab>
               </div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="HedarHom" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7796HedarHom">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Homily concerning Our Lady Mary</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="HedarMirac" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7814HedarMir">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of St Gabriel helping Josef and Nicodimus</label></div>
               
               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="HedarMir" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7797HedarMir">
                   <label xml:lang="en">Miracle of St Gabriel raising St Gabra Manfas Qǝddus on his wings to Heaven</label></div>

               <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="HedarStr">
                  <label xml:lang="en">Rhyming Strophe in honour of Gabriel for Ḫǝdār</label>
                  <ab>ለምንት፡ ሊተ፡ አይድኦተ፡ ዝንቱ፡ ድርሳን።<lb/>
                     በይነ፡ ተአምሪከ፡ ኵሉ፡ እንተ፡ አልቦቱ፡ ወሰን፡<lb/>
                     ገብርኤል፡ ፍሥሓ፡ ሠዓሬ፡ ኃዘን።<lb/>
                     አኮኑ፡ ኢይክል፡ ፈጽሞቶ፡ ለተናግሮ፡ ልሳን።<lb/>
                     በጽሒፍኒ፡ ይደክም፡ የማን።</ab>
               </div>               
            </div>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text></TEI>